\pard\b\fs20 The Red Book\b0\par
\fs16\par
The training is over, and Harkon is now officially raised to the rank of adept. His next mission takes him to the castle of Fenring, who is said to be in league with the rebels. Together with Marc, he searches both of the castle's libraries for a mysterious red book.\par
